Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.08,0:00:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The paint within brings\Nout a map of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the right,\Nall we saw stormy nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.82,0:00:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rough winds and\Nwaves coming day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.14,0:00:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had\Nwere about to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody\Nhere knows it for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.70,0:00:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So close your eyes and breathe in deeply.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.02,0:00:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And listen to your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.32,0:00:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see a path in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll know just where you need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.90,0:00:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make us stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.12,0:01:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the darkness\Nwin. Just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way,\Nthat's what's best for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.22,0:01:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And you do it your way,\Nthat's how it's got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.88,0:01:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're moving forward. Now I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.46,0:01:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But at times it's okay\Nto get help on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.30,0:01:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,For the future ahead, burning bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.86,0:01:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,For what's ahead you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.28,0:01:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.60,0:01:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.84,0:01:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.06,0:01:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the darkness\Nwin. Just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.42,0:01:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way.\NThe best that we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,With tears and doubts and tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.64,0:01:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go where we all wanna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The hate within brings colors of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.04,0:02:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Young Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.06,0:02:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.72,0:02:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The armory is in the lowest\Nlevel of the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.00,0:02:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.04,0:02:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.72,0:02:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can slow the island down even a\Nlittle bit, it might make all the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.24,0:02:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.16,0:02:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No one said this was going to be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.76,0:02:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Show some persistence, Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.88,0:02:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Show some guts!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.28,0:02:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This battle is far from over!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.04,0:02:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know the limit of your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.40,0:02:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep creating flame clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.48,0:02:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If Cloud can do it, then you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.88,0:02:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And do it better!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.04,0:02:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,More, more!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.72,0:02:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No harm will come to the Flower\NCapital, not under my watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.30,0:03:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you wouldn't challenge\Nan Emperor unprepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.16,0:03:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you caught?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.50,0:03:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your trump card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.16,0:03:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you managed to awaken your power?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.32,0:03:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that would be a damn good start.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.18,0:03:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.36,0:03:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now it takes up a lot of my stamina,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.36,0:03:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,so I need to save it\Ntill I'm on my last leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.72,0:03:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I used it too early.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.48,0:03:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll lose this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.70,0:03:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, same thing with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.12,0:03:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're not making\Nany headway like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.08,0:03:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Go all in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.84,0:03:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just follow my lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.38,0:03:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of fool do\Nyou take me for, Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.64,0:03:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I forgot about\Nthe armory you've been tolt?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.86,0:04:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I know everything you're\Nhiding down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.14,0:04:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All those weapons I manufactured,\Nall those explosives!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.34,0:04:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is going to be the biggest\Nbang in the history of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.94,0:04:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our final scene!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.38,0:04:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Druid Kanjuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.38,0:04:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn it all to the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.90,0:04:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Drive them into the debris!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.64,0:04:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Down to our brain!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.84,0:04:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The souls of the crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.06,0:04:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So we will be joining!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.94,0:04:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,seven in this day's game!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.06,0:04:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done with you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.02,0:04:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.62,0:04:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't suffer your\Nidiocy a moment longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.04,0:04:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Fukurokuju!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.90,0:04:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here already!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Flower shunikens!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.76,0:04:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic earlobe-crackers!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.78,0:04:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Avenging one's ward is\Nnever pathetic! In need!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.92,0:04:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Such sentimental nonsense\Nwill be the death of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.12,0:05:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for us to make our exit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.54,0:05:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Only Kashima will be blown to pieces,\Nand the pirates, along with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.48,0:05:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,lead them to their meaningless squabble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.88,0:05:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let them all burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.62,0:05:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You little delinquents\Nhave been very naughty,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.72,0:05:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,so take your putter and don't talk back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.54,0:05:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Koby!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.46,0:05:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma, ma, ma, ma, ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.96,0:05:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.76,0:05:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma, ma, ma, ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.70,0:06:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I got the noisy one at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.74,0:06:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.04,0:06:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,These two have been holding\Noff Big Mom all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.68,0:06:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be incredibly strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.40,0:06:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'm gonna take your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.48,0:06:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my, my, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.12,0:06:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Go all in!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.90,0:06:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just follow my lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.88,0:06:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Cave room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.72,0:06:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Anesthesia, ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.30,0:06:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Better brace yourselves, because\Nthis one's going to be painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.60,0:06:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Right back at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.04,0:06:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to show you\Nwhat real pain feels like.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.54,0:07:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,K-Room's incision is\Nharmless, but then it's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.92,0:07:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,true power comes from the\Nshockwave it generates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.18,0:07:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Shock Villa! Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.78,0:07:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.69,0:07:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you bleeding?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.80,0:07:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You cocky little shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.80,0:07:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.36,0:07:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful what you wish for!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.44,0:07:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Un-dyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I sticking to your head, Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.52,0:07:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't turn a lady into a magnet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.38,0:08:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when do you know such a nasty trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.34,0:08:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I haven't even gotten\Nto the good point yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.78,0:08:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening to the steel beams?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.80,0:08:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The villains are gonna come down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.62,0:08:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.53,0:08:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.86,0:08:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Trapanga, release it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.24,0:08:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, but don't tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.36,0:08:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, class!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.76,0:08:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.08,0:09:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they win?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.10,0:09:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They buried her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.30,0:09:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit, she's gotta be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.26,0:09:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt anyone could survive that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.30,0:09:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.86,0:09:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my best trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.36,0:09:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat metal, witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.88,0:09:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's payback for what\Nyou put me through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.68,0:09:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So your awakened power magnetizes things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.62,0:09:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom included.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.44,0:09:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That was nice work, but\Nhow long does it last for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because we worked together once doesn't\Nmean you get to learn all my secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.30,0:10:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's back up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.46,0:10:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.42,0:10:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Life or Oshiruko!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.48,0:10:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.08,0:10:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She's using Soul Pucci on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.68,0:10:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So wait, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.08,0:10:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got the soup she wants, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.62,0:10:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, no, we kind of smelled it all earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.62,0:11:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't give her soup,\Nshe'll steal our life force away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.04,0:11:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.20,0:11:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out, you fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.20,0:11:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.38,0:11:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you life!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.32,0:12:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll even throw in a year's\Nworth of my own lifespan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.20,0:12:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my fury given form.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.24,0:12:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way to make\Nmyself even more powerful?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.70,0:12:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She's growing too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.24,0:12:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, on the bright side,\Nshe's a much bigger target now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.52,0:12:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.32,0:12:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't cut through that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.16,0:13:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't send her flying either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.16,0:13:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She's too damn big.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.60,0:13:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She was huge already.\NIt's too much. How do
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.74,0:13:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,you even fight this and\Nthe fire's closing in?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.34,0:13:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This has gotten completely\Nout of hand you're
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.54,0:13:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,right this floor is a\Nliving nightmare like hell
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.52,0:13:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Itself, you've really out done yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.34,0:13:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,it's been a long time\Nsince I felt pain like
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.30,0:13:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,this decades in fact if\Nnothing else I respect
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.34,0:13:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,your strength Trafalgar Law Captain Kidd
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.22,0:13:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just like Straw Hat Luffy,\Naren't you, you young upstarts?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.60,0:13:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,all think you can push me aside\Nbut I won't be replaced so easily
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.86,0:14:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You know some of us are just\Ntrying to study history?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.66,0:14:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have to fight monsters\Njust to learn a thing or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.84,0:14:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit your damn complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.66,0:14:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we live, we have to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.32,0:14:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll knock her on that\Nthrone even if it kills me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.08,0:14:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to be an emperor that badly?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.62,0:14:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, but you'll have to wrest\Nthe title from my cold, dead body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.00,0:14:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there are lots of guards ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.90,0:14:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll head to the cave\Nchamber and take a side path.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.70,0:14:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.04,0:14:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.30,0:14:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to make even more enemies?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.46,0:14:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We were never allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.74,0:14:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, then screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.26,0:15:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Scratch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.02,0:15:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Sorry, Apu, but the game is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.62,0:15:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how your attacks work now\NI'm calling your bluff there pal at
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.82,0:15:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,first I thought they Didn't have a\Nvector but then I watched closely and
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.04,0:15:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured it out they fire when your\Ntarget Hears you and you aim them
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.64,0:15:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,with your sight hey you keep your\Nmouth shut those are trade secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.98,0:15:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, whatever, you got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.84,0:15:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're still screwed, Dino Boy! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.62,0:15:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way you're taking\Ndown three numbers on your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.00,0:15:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not backing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.68,0:15:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an obligation to\NStraw Hat and his crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.22,0:15:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,My honor demands that I\Nbeat you here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.52,0:15:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Drake and Apu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.06,0:16:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, what are you doing in the back rooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.26,0:16:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You partying?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.17,0:16:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Right back at you, young master!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.98,0:16:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you busting down walls?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.72,0:16:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Bringing down the house is my job!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.10,0:16:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were on\Nthe roof fighting Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.28,0:16:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.22,0:16:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to get to the armory right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.46,0:16:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.60,0:16:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato doesn't know he's\Na traitor yet, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.80,0:16:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.74,0:16:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Drake is useless to me either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.40,0:16:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, new plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.84,0:16:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Drake, I need to get past you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.18,0:16:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, hold up, hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.80,0:16:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,One sec, young master.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.58,0:16:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I got good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.34,0:16:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, just trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.80,0:16:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but it'll have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.30,0:16:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in a big hurry right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.22,0:16:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides that, you and I\Naren't on the same team anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.14,0:16:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally cut all ties with Kaido. I dig.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.20,0:16:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's even better, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.24,0:16:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I'm in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.88,0:16:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to play games with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.72,0:16:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't have time to fight\None of the Toby Rope either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.26,0:17:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So you'd better get out of\Nmy way! Wait, Yamato! Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.32,0:17:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll run straight through you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.28,0:17:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been warned!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.44,0:17:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, just wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.84,0:17:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I've waited long enough already! Now move!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.58,0:17:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to pick\Na fight with me, Drake!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.02,0:17:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.02,0:17:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on the same side!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.22,0:17:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I cut ties with the Beast\NPirates just like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.00,0:17:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.91,0:17:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.86,0:17:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I hope you don't hold\Nit against me when I do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.78,0:17:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, time to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.42,0:17:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to save Onigashima and\Nthe flower capital! Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.98,0:17:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is everyone so stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.42,0:17:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Good help really is hard to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.66,0:17:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can get Yamato on my side, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.24,0:17:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.26,0:18:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you running off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.26,0:18:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Is someone after me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.36,0:18:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.66,0:18:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.10,0:18:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Fuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.80,0:18:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.36,0:18:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.94,0:18:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.50,0:18:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.41,0:18:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.40,0:18:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you, man! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.30,0:18:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is everybody screwing me over?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.92,0:18:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.83,0:18:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no time to be\Ndrinking, you two! Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.58,0:18:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta stop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.20,0:18:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.68,0:18:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my dick and out of this mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.24,0:18:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here, I'm poop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.22,0:19:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away, Baron Corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.24,0:19:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And leave you? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.60,0:19:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll stay here and fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.54,0:19:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta keep Nico Robin safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.08,0:19:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, we'll go, but\Nbe careful. We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.30,0:19:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not so helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.28,0:19:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.04,0:19:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard what they said, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.68,0:19:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.22,0:19:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's precisely why we must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.38,0:19:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot allow their\Nsacrifice to be in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.78,0:19:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe they're defeating\Nthe Mink Warriors so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.26,0:20:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever those men are,\Nthey're terribly strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.38,0:20:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,CP0.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.29,0:20:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,They're a Cipher Pol unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.98,0:20:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We saw them before, back in Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.12,0:20:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They're government officers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.62,0:20:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Intelligence agents?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.96,0:20:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But what are they doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.90,0:20:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And why are they looking\Nfor you at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.80,0:20:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't say, but we're\Nfacing the worst case scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.58,0:20:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That much is apparent at least. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.92,0:20:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Cape is the top-ranked\Nunit in all of Cypher-Pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.06,0:20:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And the masked agents are the\Nmost dangerous, even amongst them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.86,0:20:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that our escape\Noptions are a little bare-bound.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.52,0:20:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo-ho-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.72,0:20:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.14,0:20:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.12,0:20:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get you to somewhere safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.50,0:20:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.10,0:20:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.88,0:20:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Jaggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.46,0:20:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a disaster...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.72,0:20:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Jaggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.46,0:21:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.58,0:21:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.30,0:21:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.34,0:21:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Judge used to talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.58,0:21:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I have nothing to do with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.38,0:21:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just a geisha from the Capitol!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.32,0:21:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He wanted to create the perfect soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.14,0:21:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.05,0:21:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,With incredible strength\Nand a heart of ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.60,0:21:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Powerful and merciless. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.44,0:21:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.86,0:21:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you help me get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.20,0:21:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't pretend you're not excited to show\Noff that germ of blood in your veins!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.86,0:21:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not like them, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.98,0:21:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'M HUMAN!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.96,0:21:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.36,0:21:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, miss? Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.58,0:21:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come any closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.02,0:22:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I need help!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.52,0:22:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Osume, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.50,0:22:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.02,0:22:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I did this to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.24,0:22:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.38,0:22:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.14,0:22:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you attack this poor girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.36,0:22:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You call yourself a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.46,0:22:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you've got this wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.24,0:22:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I would never... Excuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.38,0:22:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're fighting on the\Nside of Wano, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.76,0:22:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.18,0:22:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're doing this to your own people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.80,0:22:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.88,0:22:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what happened to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.88,0:22:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I just showed up and...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.38,0:22:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.42,0:22:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.78,0:22:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't lay a finger on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.74,0:22:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.10,0:22:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.62,0:22:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're so innocent, why did she run?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.78,0:23:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.40,0:23:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.76,0:23:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're trying to hide now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.36,0:23:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave before someone finds this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.30,0:23:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Monsters who beat up innocent\Ngirls are not welcome here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.86,0:23:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear this wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.94,0:23:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised you. Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.12,0:23:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.46,0:23:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.38,0:23:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you done enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.82,0:23:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ever show your face here again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.96,0:23:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.87,0:23:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.78,0:23:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I wouldn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.26,0:23:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.82,0:23:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.08,0:23:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I would never lay a hand on a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.42,0:23:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jermaboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.92,0:23:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.64,0:23:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What you doing over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.78,0:23:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate to break it to you, but\Nthe pleasure hall's closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.42,0:23:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.33,0:23:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the last thing I would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.60,0:24:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never hurt a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.30,0:24:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.96,0:24:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They feed a woman unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.82,0:24:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything you guys represent\Ngoes against my principles.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.82,0:24:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me I'm\Ngoing to end up like them?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.92,0:24:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.24,0:24:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My body isn't tingling anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.72,0:24:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it already happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.08,0:24:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I was caught up in my thoughts when\NI ran into that girl in the hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.72,0:24:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It took me a second to notice her, and\Nthen she went flying, and she was bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.66,0:24:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She looked at me with fear in her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.42,0:24:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.68,0:24:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.36,0:24:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of man do you want on your crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.46,0:24:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,An unreliable dreamer like me,\Nwho's afraid of his own power,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.00,0:24:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,who's helpless every\Ntime he faces a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.78,0:24:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Or a warrior of science who can beat up a
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.40,0:25:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,monster like this\Nwithout a second thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.70,0:25:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,who has a heart of ice and a\Nwill of steel that never fails?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.42,0:25:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Which would be more useful\Nto the King of the Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.18,0:25:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you on my crew, Saadji!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.80,0:25:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.16,0:25:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what'll happen\Nfrom here on out, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.50,0:25:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the Germa suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.22,0:25:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna wear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.46,0:25:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.04,0:25:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,When I put this suit on,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.46,0:25:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,it awakened a power that's been\Ninside me since I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.86,0:25:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything to change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.52,0:25:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you finally get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.86,0:25:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, suit up, Jermaboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.50,0:25:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What I can do is put\Nan end to all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.52,0:26:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you on my crew, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.96,0:26:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Without you, without you, I'll\Nnever be king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.50,0:26:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.54,0:26:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm choosing my own fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.56,0:26:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.52,0:26:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I said put it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.56,0:26:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Not destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.66,0:26:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Jeremiah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.18,0:26:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, women's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.64,0:26:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna finish this\Nfight on my own terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.08,0:26:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.42,0:26:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Collect.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.68,0:26:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.90,0:26:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,When do I have this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.86,0:27:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's calling me at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.56,0:27:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm busy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.52,0:27:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I was afraid you might be\Ndying in a ditch somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.40,0:27:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So I snuck that snail on\Nyou as a safety precaution.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.14,0:27:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not dying, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.62,0:27:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you leave me alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.78,0:27:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, this won't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.54,0:27:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.42,0:27:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We're beating the beast\Npirates no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.44,0:27:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.54,0:27:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But after the battle, there's a chance\NI might not be in my right mind anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.18,0:27:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If that happens, then kill me. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.70,0:28:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still there?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.24,0:28:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.12,0:28:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.20,0:28:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you, just like you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.80,0:28:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get what your problem is, but at\Nleast I got something to look forward to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.12,0:28:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So until then, don't you dare die on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.50,0:28:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.04,0:28:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,lick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.95,0:28:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.38,0:28:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You got invisibility tech?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.80,0:28:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet daddy gave you that too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.90,0:28:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need you adding fuel to the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.52,0:29:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm already burning up!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.90,0:29:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'M SENDING YOU STRAIGHT TO HELL!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.50,0:29:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,HELL MEMORIES!
